# Mega Man Zero 3 (USA): title screen, the intro and the mission briefing, then Zero in play on a snowy stage (gate G9, route depth).
# Start and A taps every 30 frames from frame 300 to 12,800 (the title, the new game, the text crawl, the dialogue), then A taps to 19,800 (A jumps once the stage has started).
# Zero stands and jumps in the snow with his life gauge on screen from about frame 19,000; the frame limit is 20,000. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
